flowchart TD
    parameters[Seed and bounded layout parameters] --> core[Existing Core compiler and canonical IR]
    core --> search[Existing Graph BFS and A star]
    search --> validity[Reachability and path witness]
    search --> score[Expanded nodes with fixed solver configuration]
    validity --> selection[First feasible baseline and best of budget]
    score --> selection
    selection --> emitter[Existing HyMeKo emitter and recompile]
    emitter --> sdf[Existing Gazebo query and template renderer]
    sdf --> remote[Finite Gazebo validation on Amaterasu]
    selection --> measurements[Amaterasu campaign measurements]
    remote --> report[JSON plots path GIF and archived report]
    measurements --> report
